{"id":354,"flavor":[{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Resentment at being cast off made it spring into being. Some say that treating it well will satisfy it, and it will once more become a stuffed toy."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It’s a stuffed toy that was thrown away and became possessed, ever searching for the one who threw it away so it can exact its revenge."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"A cursed energy permeated the stuffing of a discarded and forgotten plush doll, giving it new life as Banette. The Pokémon’s energy would escape if it were to ever open its mouth."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Banette generates energy for laying strong curses by sticking pins into its own body. This Pokémon was originally a pitiful plush doll that was thrown away."},{"games":["Y","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"Strong feelings of hatred turned a puppet into a Pokémon. If it opens its mouth, its cursed energy escapes."},{"games":["X","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge from being junked. It seeks the child that disowned it."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge of being thrown away. It seeks the child who disowned it."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"This Pokémon developed from an abandoned doll that amassed a grudge. It is seen in dark alleys."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"An abandoned plush doll became this POKéMON. They are said to live in garbage dumps and wander about in search of the children that threw them away."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Insomnia","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's insomnia prevents it from falling asleep."},{"name":"Frisk","hidden":false,"description":"When it enters a battle, the Pokémon can check an opposing Pokémon's held item."},{"name":"Cursed Body","hidden":true,"description":"May disable a move that has dealt damage to the Pokémon."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCou